1st round of the Vodafone Lead DevOps Engineer interview Experience.

The round was filled with real-world, advanced scenario-based questions.
The interview covered deep technical discussions on:
🔹 AWS
 🔹 GCP 
 🔹 Kubernetes 
 🔹 Terraform
 🔹 Docker 

This shows that when you prepare with the right mindset, focus on hands-on skills, and practice scenario-based questions, cracking big interviews becomes a lot easier.

🔸 AWS – Advanced Scenarios
Your application latency suddenly increased in Production. How do you troubleshoot across ALB → EC2 → RDS → VPC flow?
You need zero-downtime deployment for an API running on EC2. Which strategy would you choose — Blue/Green or Rolling — and why?
How do you secure cross-account access for CI/CD pipelines using IAM roles?
Your Lambda function is hitting cold starts during spikes. How do you fix it?
How do you design a highly available VPC across 3 AZs with private subnets, NAT gateways, and on-prem connectivity?

🔸 GCP – Real-World Problems
Your GKE workloads need to securely connect to BigQuery & Cloud SQL. How would you design IAM + VPC + service accounts?
When would you choose Cloud Run vs GKE vs Compute Engine?
How do you implement multi-region failover in GCP?
How would you reduce cost for workloads running 24/7 on GKE?
How do you design a CI/CD pipeline using Cloud Build + Artifact Registry + GKE?

🔸 Kubernetes – Production Scenarios
Pods are restarting frequently with OOMKilled. How do you troubleshoot and fix this?
How do you restrict one namespace from accessing another namespace’s services?
Explain how traffic flows when you run kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml from client → API server → etcd → scheduler → kubelet.
How do you perform a safe rollback when the new deployment is causing errors?
How do you debug a CrashLoopBackOff pod in Prod?

🔸 Terraform – Infrastructure Scenarios
How do you manage Terraform state for multiple teams and multiple environments (Dev/QA/Prod)?
You changed a resource that Terraform wants to recreate (destroy + create). How do you prevent downtime?
How do you design a Terraform module for reusable VPC creation?
State file got corrupted or locked — what is your approach?
How would you implement CI/CD for Terraform using Jenkins or GitHub Actions?

🔸 Docker – Advanced Concepts
How do you reduce Docker image size for a Java/Python/Node app using multi-stage builds?
How do you debug a container that keeps failing inside Kubernetes?
How do you manage credentials/secrets inside containers securely?
What is the difference between ENTRYPOINT vs CMD in real deployment use cases?
Your container works locally but fails in Kubernetes — what is your debugging approach?
